    <div id="mainContent">
            <p class="Division"><a name="13.09.005"></a>Division 13-09-005<br />Reimbursement Agreement</p>


            <p class="digCH">Sections:</p>

            <p class="CiteTOC"><a href="../Flagstaff13/Flagstaff1309005.html#13.09.005.0001">13-09-005-0001</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Reimbursement Agreement</p>

      <h3 class="Cite" id="13.09.005.0001"><a name="13.09.005.0001">13-09-005-0001</a> Reimbursement Agreement</h3>
            <p class="P0">If a developer or owner extends a water or sewer main across undeveloped property to reach its development or property, and wishes to be reimbursed for the cost of installing said extension by future customers that will be benefited or served by the new line extension, the developer or owner may request a reimbursement agreement pursuant to Section <a href="../Flagstaff07/Flagstaff0708000.html#7.08.001.0005">7-08-001-0005</a>, Reimbursement Agreements. (Ord. 2017-22, Rep&amp;ReEn, 07/05/2017; Ord. 2022-33, Amended, 12/13/2022)</p>

    </div>
